#### 5.3. SharePoint Upload Method (pseudo-code)

You would need to implement this method to upload files to SharePoint:

```csharp
private async Task<string> UploadToSharePoint(IFormFile file)
{
    // Use HttpClient or an appropriate SharePoint client here
    var apiKey = _configuration["SharePoint:ApiKey"]; // Fetch from config
    var url = "https://yourSharePointUrl/upload"; // Update with real endpoint

    using var client = new HttpClient();
    client.DefaultRequestHeaders.Authorization = new AuthenticationHeaderValue("Bearer", apiKey);
    
    using var content = new MultipartFormDataContent();
    using var stream = file.OpenReadStream();
    content.Add(new StreamContent(stream), "file", file.FileName);

    var response = await client.PostAsync(url, content);
    if (response.IsSuccessStatusCode)
    {
        // Parse response to get SharePoint file link
        return await response.Content.ReadAsStringAsync(); // Adjust accordingly
    }
    
    throw new Exception("Failed to upload file to SharePoint.");
}
```

